  "headline": "Sodium chloride is not on FDA's current shortage list; an earlier shortage was first posted 2018-06-21 and is resolved",
  "headline_cites": ["D27"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show sodium chloride is not on the current shortage list as of 2026-10-21, and the earlier shortage first posted 2018-06-21 is resolved.",
      "cites": ["D27"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection history for registered plants includes multiple VAI and OAI classifications and warning letters, but none occurred before the 2018-06-21 posting at a registered plant linked to our supply.",
      "cites": ["D11", "D12", "D13", "D14", "D15", "D16", "D17", "D18", "D19", "D20", "D21", "D22", "D23", "D24", "D25", "D26"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our supply of 9 mg/mL, 50 mL sodium chloride is labeled by B. Braun Medical Inc. (NDC 00264180031) at both Corvale Lakeside and Corvale East.",
      "cites": ["E10", "E2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 117 units with 16.7 days on hand; Corvale East holds 349 units with 9.2 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D4", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked action is to transfer 18 units of 9 mg/mL, 50 mL from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East, which would leave Lakeside with 14 days and bring East to 10 days.",
      "cites": ["D28"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alternative manufacturers not on FDA's shortage list today include Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. (last inspection NAI 2026-05-13) and Medefil, Inc.",
      "cites": ["D29", "D30"]
    }
  ]
}
